      "id": "7",
      "title": "Agent Message Handling and DSPy Execution",
      "description": "Message processing flow - daemon polls mailbox, routes by message type, handleAsk/handleCmd invoke dspyAgent.Execute which triggers tool calls, reply sent",
      "locations": [
        {
          "id": "7a",
          "path": "internal/agent/daemon/daemon.go",
          "lineNumber": 252,
          "lineContent": "for _, msg := range messages {",
          "title": "Message iteration",
